gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhaoyunxing92/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhaoyunxing92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhaoyunxing92/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhaoyunxing92/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhaoyunxing92/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhaoyunxing92/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhaoyunxing92/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-08-08T12:39:55Z","updated_at":"2022-08-08T12:39:55Z","body":"主要是`AbstractConfig#equals`方法没有看`parameters`的参数\r\nhttps://github.com/apache/dubbo/blob/3.0/dubbo-common/src/main/java/org/apache/dubbo/config/context/AbstractConfigManager.java#L161-L167\r\n```java\r\n if (!(config instanceof ReferenceConfigBase || config instanceof ServiceConfigBase)) {\r\n            for (AbstractConfig value : configsMap.values()) {\r\n                if (value.equals(config)) {\r\n                    return (T) value;\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n```\r\n\r\n[AbstractConfig#equals](https://github.com/apache/dubbo/blob/3.0/dubbo-common/src/main/java/org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java#L959-L983) 方法列表没有`getParameters()`\r\n```java\r\npublic boolean equals(Object obj) {\r\n        if (obj == null || obj.getClass() != this.getClass()) {\r\n            return false;\r\n        }\r\n        if (obj == this) {\r\n            return true;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        for (Method method : getAttributedMethods()) {\r\n            // ignore compare 'id' value\r\n            if (\"getId\".equals(method.getName())) {\r\n                continue;\r\n            }\r\n            try {\r\n                Object value1 = method.invoke(this);\r\n                Object value2 = method.invoke(obj);\r\n                if (!Objects.equals(value1, value2)) {\r\n                    return false;\r\n                }\r\n            } catch (Exception e) {\r\n                throw new IllegalStateException(\"compare config instances failed\", e);\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n        return true;\r\n    }\r\n```\r\n[MethodUtils.isGetter](https://github.com/apache/dubbo/blob/3.0/dubbo-common/src/main/java/org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java#L77)判断返回类型是Map的方法不是get","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/comments/1208075564/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"zhaoyunxing92","id":18088210,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDg4MjEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18088210?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhaoyunxing92","html_url":"https://github.com/zhaoyunxing92","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhaoyunxing92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhaoyunxing92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhaoyunxing92/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhaoyunxing92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhaoyunxing92/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhaoyunxing92/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhaoyunxing92/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhaoyunxing92/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhaoyunxing92/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"actor":{"login":"zhaoyunxing92","id":18088210,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDg4MjEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18088210?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhaoyunxing92","html_url":"https://github.com/zhaoyunxing92","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users